 "remarks": "Welcome to Putnam Green Apts- a garden style community offering the perfect blend of modern comfort and Greenwich charm. This beautifully updated townhouse style apt features new modern appliances including brand new washer/dryer, stylish finishes and bright open layout. Enjoy a peaceful residential setting surrounded by lush greenery, from your private patio, while being only minutes away from renowned restaurants, cafes, boutique shopping, art galleries, and entertainment. Commuters will love the easy access to Greenwich Ave, I 95 and the Metro North train station, making trips to NYC a breeze! On site parking included.",
